                "html": "<div class=\"hero-interior\"><div class=\"hero-interior__inner\"><div class=\"hero-interior__eyebrow\">The Flagship Model</div><h1 class=\"hero-interior__headline\">Exit to Client. The sale that serves everyone.</h1><p class=\"hero-interior__subheadline\">Your clients trust you. They already know what your practice is worth. Why not sell it to them?</p></div></div>"
