              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"section section--warm\"><div class=\"section__inner\"><h2 class=\"section__headline section__headline--center\">How Exit to Client Works</h2><div class=\"steps\"><div class=\"step reveal\"><div class=\"step__num\">1</div><div><h3 class=\"step__title\">Evaluate</h3><div class=\"step__body\"><p>We help you assess your practice's true value — not just the revenue multiple, but the client relationships, the trust capital, and the community you've built over decades.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"step reveal reveal-d1\"><div class=\"step__num\">2</div><div><h3 class=\"step__title\">Design the Ownership Structure</h3><div class=\"step__body\"><p>We build a model that lets your clients buy in — either as a group or through a structured vehicle. They become owners. You become free. The practice stays in the hands of the people who love it.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"step reveal reveal-d2\"><div class=\"step__num\">3</div><div><h3 class=\"step__title\">Transition on Your Terms</h3><div class=\"step__body\"><p>You set the timeline. You stay as long as you want — or leave as soon as you're ready. The transition happens when it's right for you, your clients, and your legacy.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
              },
              "elements": []
            }
          ]
